                "metadata": {
                    "category": "music",
                    "description": "Merry moments and lullaby magic—celebrate the season with gentle Christmas songs that sparkle with warmth, wonder, and peace. \n\nCozy carols, charming serenades, and a sprinkle of holiday magic: JJ Heller’s I Dream of You: CHRISTMAS reimagines classic songs with lush orchestral warmth, a British boys choir, and JJ’s tender, timeless voice. It’s the perfect mix of sacred and sweet, made for decorating the tree, sipping cocoa, or snuggling up by the fire with hearts aglow.",
